{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32959","headline":"水晶枕 · 崔珏","name":"水晶枕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年积雪万年冰，掌上初擎力不胜。\n南国旧知何处得，北方寒气此中凝。\n黄昏转烛萤飞沼，白日褰帘水在簪。\n蕲簟蜀琴相对好，裁诗乞与涤烦襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}